  "question": {
    "text": "For $0 \\leq P, Q \\leq \\frac{\\pi}{2},$ if $\\sin P+\\cos Q=2$, then the\r\nvalue of $\\tan \\left(\\frac{\\vec{P}+Q}{2}\\right)$ is equal to",
